{
  "title": "Oozy Mediterranean Fish Wrap",
  "description": "A lazy Sunday Mediterranean dish featuring sashimi cut fish, umeboshi, and lacto vegetarian friendly ingredients, all wrapped in a ti leaf.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
