  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees.",
    "In a bowl, mix together chopped umeboshi, crumbly feta cheese, pitted kalamata olives, canned artichoke hearts, and chopped sun dried tomatoes.",
    "Season the sashimi cut fish with salt and pepper.",
    "Place a portion of the fish in the center of each ti leaf.",
    "Spoon the umeboshi mixture over the fish.",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Fold the ti leaves to enclose the filling.",
    "Bake for 12 minutes or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Serve immediately."
  ],
